    basic: "Don't think, just play. Scan both piles constantly. If you have a run (5, 6, 7), arrange them in your hand so you can slam them down in one motion.",
    intermediate: 'Blocking: If you see your opponent hesitating with a card, play on that pile to change the number and mess them up. If you have doubles (two 6s), play one on a 5, wait for opponent to play 7? No, play 6 on 5, then play 7 on 6? Speed is key.',
